==Description==
The '''Snowflakes Nametag''' is a nametag that could be obtained from [[Krampus' Revenge Event#Krampus' Revenge Season Pass|Krampus' Revenge Season]] at Rank 5, which requires {{Cookies|1,500}} or {{Robux|210}} total.

The '''Snowflakes Nametag''' has white text and a light grey outline. Small grey clouds appear behind the text, from which snowflakes appear that slowly fall down. It also emits white sparkles.

